TOOL 2 DR-6
SECTION
Rapid X 12000 Y 0 Z 5000 A 0 B 0 C 0
Feed X 8000 Y 0 Z 5000 F 200000 A 0 B 0 C 0
Rapid X 12000 Y 0 Z 5000 A 0 B 0 C 0
ENDSECTION
